# CR 601.2h: a monocoloured hybrid shard ({2/W}) paid on its coloured side --
# ChoosePayMonocoloredHybrid true -- spends exactly one white mana, not the
# two generic mana-payment-monocolored-hybrid-generic's own false branch asks
# for instead.
# Main phase of turn 1, so the payment is made at a priority (L2 S19); the
# lands are tapped there, since a pool loaded by setup.state empties as the
# steps pass (CR 500.4).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 W
queue paymonocoloredhybrid true
paymanacost human 2/W
